Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;
public class Main {
    static double total(List<? extends Number> input) {
        double sum = 0;
        for (Number value : input) sum += value.doubleValue();
        return sum;
    }
    static void addOne(List<? super Integer> output) { output.add(1); }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<Integer> input = List.of(2, 3);
        List<Number> output = new ArrayList<>();
        addOne(output);
        System.out.println(total(input));
        System.out.println(output.size());
    }
}

```

